  "why_n_action_is_28_everywhere": "The action vector is role-ordered and always 28 wide. Masked roles are ignored by the runtime; the joint is PD-held at nominal. A few wasted floats buy a bit-identical interface_sha256 across every creature, which is what lets one ONNX be loaded unchanged by every engine and by the physical robot."
}
